id: DRAFT-buildtorrent-0.9.1-autoconf-umask-tmpdir-readonly-fix
trigger_tool: configure|conan|make
phase: compile
error_signature: config\.status: error: could not setup config files machinery|HMBS_PLATFORM_CAPABILITIES=\{[^}]*"chmod":0
severity: 3
category: autotools, build-system, platform, hmdfs, ohos
match_keywords: readonly_tmp, temporary_directory_readonly, hmbs_platform_capabilities, hmbs_cap_chmod, umask 077, mktemp
title: HMFS下Autoconf因umask 077与toybox mktemp导致config.status临时目录只读的通用修复
root_cause: HMFS上toybox mktemp -d按umask 077创建drwx--S---目录并拒绝后续写入，Autoconf AS_TMPDIR首选mktemp路径命中该受限目录即硬失败，config.status无法创建subs1.awk等临时文件
 opting scope: placeholder
affected_scope: 跨Autotools库可复用，configure含umask 077且依赖mktemp创建AS_TMPDIR的Autoconf包在HMFS真机均命中
verification_cmd: 真机preflight compile阶段不再报config.status错误并进入后续编译，temporary_directory_readonly消失
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: remove-umask-redirect-tmpdir-chmod-tolerant
rec_description: 正则删除configure及内嵌config.status模板中umask 077，将TMPDIR/TMP/TEMP重定向到HMBS可写tmpdir，SHELL规范为/bin/sh且chmod容错
rec_command: conanfile.py新增_patch_configure_umask()正则删umask 077及mktemp两处；build()首部TMPDIR/TMP/TEMP指向HMBS注入tmpdir，SHELL/CONFIG_SHELL=/bin/sh，chmod +x容错
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: conan-recipe-fix
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: manual-tmpdir-export-retry
fallback_description: 若正则未覆盖内嵌模板，手动导出TMPDIR到可写路径后重试configure，仍保留umask删除
fallback_auto_fix: false
forbid_1_pattern: config\.status: error: could not setup config files machinery
forbid_1_reason: 禁止用mktemp exit-1 shim替代umask根因修复；HMBS_CAP_CHMOD=0下shim不可执行且mkdir回退仍带umask 077
forbid_1_consequence: temporary_directory_readonly未消除，真机compile持续失败退回修复循环
similar_to: []
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-buildtorrent-0.9.1-autoconf-umask-tmpdir-readonly-fix.md
last_updated: 2026-09-06
source_event: buildtorrent/0.9.1真机预检temporary_directory_readonly并修复越过config.status
authors: hmbs-executor
source_pr: 8618
